      "repair_reason": "structured ClawSweeper needs-human verdict with repairable P-severity findings (sha=6cfa9f072f58a3008f3be9dbfbd6cad23cdc210d)",
      "review_summary": "The PR wraps runtime JSON output serialization in try/catch and falls back to stringifying `String(value)` when serialization fails.\n\nPR surface: Source +8. Total +8 across 1 file.\n\nReproducibility: yes. Source inspection shows current main stringifies unknown runtime JSON values directly, and a focused Node probe matching the proposed fallback shows it can still throw for a circular null-prototype object.",
